                                "sense_id": "46e05ca4-4404-3d63-a3ad-47d83d62abb9",
                                "text": "Ali took a cup of tea, and Wajahat stopped conversation till the waiter left and then continued, “We can also take arms and fight for our Azadi. We should prove that we are not cowards. We can also fight for our cause, for our rights.”"
                            },
                            {
